  "description": "Borgman Earls are delighted to present 58 Conquer Hill Road to the Dublin Sales Market. The property is a well maintained & extended two-bedroom mid-terraced home, ideally located just a short stroll from Clontarf's seafront.\n\nExtending to approximately 82 sq. m. (883 sq. ft.), the property offers bright, comfortable accommodation with a particularly generous open-plan layout at ground floor level.\n\nThe front living room opens through to a spacious lounge area, creating a lovely sense of space through the centre of the house. To the rear, the extended kitchen/dining room overlooks the low-maintenance garden with decked area – a private and easy-to-manage outdoor space. A separate utility room and downstairs WC complete the ground floor accommodation.\n\nUpstairs there are two well-proportioned double bedrooms together with the main bathroom. To the front, the property benefits from off-street parking.\n\nConquer Hill Road is a mature, tree-lined residential road in a particularly convenient part of Clontarf, with the seafront just moments away. Vernon Avenue is within easy walking distance and offers an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants, bars and local amenities.\n\nA number of well-known schools are also close by, including Belgrove National Boys and Girls Schools, Holy Faith Secondary School and Greenlanes National School.\n\nFor those who enjoy the outdoors, some of Clontarf's best-known amenities are on the doorstep, with Dollymount Strand, St Anne's Park and Bull Island Nature Reserve all within easy reach. Clontarf Castle and a wide choice of sporting and recreational facilities are also nearby.\n\nThe location offers excellent access to Dublin City Centre, the IFSC and EastPoint Business Park, making No. 58 a very appealing home in one of Dublin's most established coastal neighbourhoods.\n\nOur first OPEN VIEWING will be held on SATURDAY 3RD OCTOBER BETWEEN 10.30am - 11.15AM.\nAccommodation\nEntrance Level\n\nEntrance Porch - 0.93m x 1.52m\nLeading to main hallway.\n\nEntrance Hallway – 2.79m x 1.75m\nStairs leading to first floor level.\n\nLounge / Dining Room – 6.17m x 4.92m\nGenerous open-plan living and dining space with feature fireplace.\n\nKitchen / Breakfast Room – 4.95m x 3.11m\nSpacious extended kitchen/breakfast room overlooking and with access to the rear garden.\n\nUtility Room – 2.08m x 1.38m\nSeparate utility room located off the kitchen including guest WC.\n\nFirst Floor\n\nBedroom 1 – 3.33m x 2.00m\nDouble bedroom with built-in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 – 2.76m x 2.99m\nDouble bedroom.\n\nBathroom – 1.84m x 1.75m\nBath including shower.\n\nHot Press\n\nTotal Floor Area: Approx. 82 sq. m. / 883 sq. ft.",
